  "blocks": [
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": true,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "两个因式的积,其中一个因子恒等于一个单项式的平方:",
        "$9a^7=9a^6\\times a=(3a^3)^2\\times a$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "那么,根据非负的因式的积的平方根的定理,得:",
        "$\\sqrt{9a^7}=\\sqrt{(3a^3)^2a}=\\sqrt{(3a^3)^2}\\cdot\\sqrt{a}=|3a^3|\\cdot\\sqrt{a}↵=3a^3\\sqrt{a}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例 2 在$-4\\sqrt{3}$的表示式里,把因数移到根号下面."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$-4\\sqrt{3}$的值是负的. 因此不能把$-4\\sqrt{3}$写成算术平方",
        "根. 但是这个式子可以变形为:",
        "$-4\\sqrt{3}=-1\\times4\\sqrt{3}=-1\\times\\sqrt{16}\\times\\sqrt{3}=-\\sqrt{48}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "把正因数$4$移到根号下面以后,我们把$-4\\sqrt{3}$写成了和",
        "算术平方根相反的表示式."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "例 3 在$a\\sqrt{2}$的表示式里,把因数移到根号下面."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "在式$a\\sqrt{2}$里,因数$a$可以是非负数,也可以是负数."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果$a\\geq0$, 那么$a\\sqrt{2}=\\sqrt{a^2}\\cdot\\sqrt{2}=\\sqrt{2a^2}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "如果$a<0$, 那么$-a>0$, $a\\sqrt{2}=-(-a)\\sqrt{2}↵=\\sqrt{(-a)^2}\\cdot\\sqrt{2}=-\\sqrt{a^2}\\cdot\\sqrt{2}=-\\sqrt{2a^2}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "820",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "820. 从根号下面提出因数:",
        "а) $\\sqrt{12}$; б) $\\sqrt{18}$; в) $\\sqrt{50}$; г) $\\sqrt{48}$;",
        "д) $\\sqrt{125}$; е) $\\sqrt{108}$; ж) $\\sqrt{363}$; з) $\\sqrt{845}$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "821",
